  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The object in FLIR1, a 2004 infrared video filmed from a Navy jet off Southern California, can be rebuilt in three dimensions using the angle of the sun. Marik von Rennenkampff, who argues the UFO side in a debate with the skeptic Mick West, says that by working out which way the pilot, Chad Underwood, was flying and where the sun stood, around 320 to 330 degrees, \"give or take,\" you can work out the object's true shape. He offers this as his own analysis to push back against readings that the object was something ordinary."
